 "summaries": [
  {
   "version": "Introduced in House",
   "date": "2017-05-04",
   "text": "FCRA Liability Harmonization Act\n This bill amends the Fair Credit Reporting Act to limit the recovery amount available in a class action lawsuit to the lesser of $500,000 or 1% of the net worth of the defendant. The bill also eliminates the awarding of punitive damages."
  }
